WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.725
src names the picture file, and alt describes it

2
00:00:04.401 --> 00:00:08.051
&lt;img&gt; shows a picture. It has no closing tag.

3
00:00:08.676 --> 00:00:11.001
src names the picture file...

4
00:00:11.872 --> 00:00:14.372
...and alt says what the picture shows.

5
00:00:15.194 --> 00:00:19.769
The file name is spelt wrong, so people see the alt words instead.

6
00:00:20.694 --> 00:00:23.419
Fix the name, and the picture appears.
